      },
      "message": "feat(ui): one side preview on the tool page, drawn from the checked holder shape\n\nThe tool page's side preview draws the bands from tool_body::checked_bands:\nthe checked profile (floored for a machine default, as judged does) through\ntool_body::stack, the stack the collision check sweeps. The 3D mesh view\nshows only while a Pick button is armed, so the page has one preview at rest.\n\nFixes #2017\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
