        "date": "2026-11-18T21:26:15Z"
      },
      "message": "fix(ui): a drag orbits the placement preview while a pick is armed\n\nThe 3D placement view shows only while a Pick button is armed, but its\ndrag handler orbited only with no pick armed, so the view could never\nturn. A drag now orbits in each mode; egui reports no click for a drag,\nso the armed pick waits for a plain click. View rotation stays\nimmediate-mode state.\n\nPinned by dragging_the_placement_preview_rotates_without_consuming_the_pick.\n\nRefs #2017\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus <noreply@anthropic.com>",
      "tree": {
        "sha": "274c96f211da7b1b6775c0f8a62a0a64aaf0460f",
